    skos:definition 'A correction for the presence of bacterial chlorophyll-c and -d was applied to the recorded data as detailed in Caraco & Puccoon (1986). The measurement of bacterial chlorophyll and algal chlorophyll a in natural waters. Limnol. Oceanogr. 31(4): 889-893; Golterman, Clymo & Ohnstad MAM (1978). Methods of physical and chemical analysis of fresh water. Blackwell Scientific Publishers, Oxford, 214p.'@en ;
