    skos:prefLabel 'normalisation to organic carbon and lutum content (RIKZ \'standard sediment\')'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A trace chemical analysis method where the recorded value is normalised to the Dutch Rijkswaterstaat standard sediment having 10% organic matter, or equivalently 5% organic carbon.'@en ;
